Z||000000||Motorhead||05-08-99||03:35 PM||||Funny how stupid mistakes repeat themselves occasionally.<p>Spent all sorts of time making sure engine timing was set after re-assembly. Dumb thing is, I didn't tighten distributor bolt sufficiantly after adjusting timing. Needless to say, timing creeped into left field as the car was driven. DUUUHHH!!!<p>All better now! Runs like a scalded dog! Even starts hot.<p>Sorry for the run around ya'll, but I sure got lots of good advice for any future problems.<p>Maybe I'll do a Lexus next, can't be any more mystical than this Pontiac!<br>
